  <History Date="11-07-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very poor documentation.  Russian translated by Google image.  mostly nonsense.  97 channel mode is missing channels 1-18.  111 and 148 channel modes not documented fully and don't make sense.  assumed 132 and 169 channels respectively.  it also doesn't make sense that the 99 (and 97) channel mode has only 19 pixels...  no pixel layout)" Version="0" />
